        "payload": "tree 0196cdd5a94bc54fda3efcad8dc49f2a345fed84\nparent 26ec83a174b3ca03ecf2b81cff7b4b2366c9c651\nauthor Zakaria Talbi Lalmi <zakariatalbi@eprosima.com> 1790071282 +0200\ncommitter Miguel Company <miguelcompany@eprosima.com> 1790318727 +0200\n\nFix several DATA_FRAG CVEs\n\n* Fix [GHSA-w92j-25c7-68qx] by rejecting DATA_FRAG submessages with a zero\n  fragment size, sample size, fragments-in-submessage or starting number.\n* Fix [GHSA-33xc-m88x-3cp8] by checking that the pending change buffer fits the\n  new fragmentation before reusing it on the StatelessReader DATA_FRAG path.\n* Fix [GHSA-f5r6-qvhq-mx93] by reserving room for the fragment index when\n  calculating the required payload size of a single-fragment sample.\n\nThis is a squashed commit of a privately reviewed branch.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zakaria Talbi Lalmi <zakariatalbi@eprosima.com>\nReviewed-by: Carlos Ferreira González <carlosferreira@eprosima.com>\n",
